        {
          "text": "Saamigii Reer Simecoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saamigii labaadna wuxuu u soo baxay reer Simecoon, oo waa dhaxalkii ay qabiilkii reer Simecoon u heleen siday reerahoodu ahaayeen. Oo dhaxalkooduna wuxuu ku dhex jiray dhaxalkii reer Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay dhaxal u heleen: Bi'ir Shebac, ama shebac, iyo Molaadaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Hasar Shuucaal, iyo Baalaah, iyo Cesem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Eltoolad, iyo Betuul, iyo Hormaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Siiqlag, iyo Beytmarkaabod, iyo Hasar Suusaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Beytlebaa'ood, iyo Shaaruuhen, oo intaasu waa saddex iyo toban magaalo iyo tuulooyinkoodii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cayn, iyo Rimmon, iyo Ceter, iyo Caashaan, oo intaasu waa afar magaalo iyo tuulooyinkoodii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo tuulooyinkii ku wareegsanaa magaalooyinkaas oo dhan ee ku yiil tan iyo Bacalad Bi'ir, iyo Raamaahda Koonfureed. Intaasu waa dhaxalkii qabiilkii reer Simecoon sidii ay reerahoodii ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qaybtii reer Yahuudah waxaa ku jiray dhaxalkii reer Simecoon, maxaa yeelay, reer Yahuudah qaybtoodu waa ku badnaa; sidaas daraaddeed reer Simecoon waxay dhaxal ka heleen dhaxalkii reer Yahuudah dhexdiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saamigii Reer Sebulun",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saamigii saddexaadna wuxuu u soo baxay reer Sebulun siday reerahoodu ahaayeen, oo dhaxalkoodii soohdintiisuna waxay ahayd ilaa Saariid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdintoodu waxay u baxday xagga galbeed, iyo xataa ilaa Marcalaah, oo waxay gaadhay tan iyo Dabbaashed, oo haddana waxay gaadhay tan iyo durdurka ku yaal Yoqnecaam horteeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay Saariid uga leexatay xagga bari ee qorraxdu ka soo baxdo, ilaa soohdinta Kislod Taabor, kolkaasay waxay u baxday xagga Daberad, oo haddana kor ugu baxday Yaafiica, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo halkaasna waxay uga gudubtay xagga bari oo martay Gad Heefer iyo tan iyo Citaah Qaasiin, oo waxay u baxday xagga Rimmon oo gaadhaa ilaa Neecaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soohdintu waxay xagga woqooyi ugu laabatay Xannaatoon, oo soohdinta dhammaadkeedu wuxuu ahaa dooxadii Yiftax'eel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Qataad, iyo Nahalaal, iyo Shimroon, iyo Idalaah, iyo Beytlaxam, intaasu waa laba iyo toban magaalo iyo tuulooyinkoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intaasu waa dhaxalkii ay reer Sebulun u heleen sidii reerahoodii ahaayeen, iyo xataa magaalooyinkan iyo tuulooyinkooduba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
