          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intaasu waa dhaxalkii ay qabiilkii reer Aasheer u heleen sidii reerahoodii ahaayeen, iyo xataa magaalooyinkan iyo tuulooyinkooduba",
          "type": "text",
