              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdintii reer Daan iyagay ka baxday, oo intay reer Daan tageen ayay la dirireen Leshem, oo way qabsadeen, oo dadkii degganaana waxay ku laayeen seef markaasay Leshem hantiyeen oo iska degeen, oo waxay u bixiyeen Daan, kaas oo ahaa magicii awowgood Daan. ",
